                  <nc xml:id="m-ba94d290-2bb7-4be4-947f-856743c81523" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-ba7e56ef-c889-4dad-b44a-d14cb63a9d79" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-0b4b92dd-69f1-4b7b-a5e1-2967152b15cb" facs="#m-13f42af3-a892-4e6e-8e20-dc89e13670ea" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-a1957dc8-ef5c-4446-8c25-eb67f3bb32a3">
            <lg xml:id="m-4891051c-9c1d-4dcc-90af-3b632017877b">
              <l xml:id="m-0b08a66b-0772-486f-baf6-7279d52d2628" facs="#m-48983f4f-67ee-4c06-b21e-1e5003ae66e8" label="ambiguous">1428</l><l xml:id="m-f5e845dd-67db-4a8c-9d76-270cfb01c4b1" facs="#m-fbfcc16c-1c12-4e3d-8d06-5b7ae840d499" label="ambiguous">April 14.</l><l xml:id="m-c21b41ff-30ba-438f-bae6-ac8cedc9b997" facs="#m-de7c17e0-a17e-418b-81c2-29e3eab0971d" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 1. Cor. I.</l><l xml:id="m-286eef47-751f-436d-b60d-b66dec095501" facs="#m-f62a5f62-2257-4a2a-a5e2-8a7af9511f3c" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Verbum crucis, pereún- petunt, et Graeci sapiéntiam quae¬</l><l xml:id="m-4088433a-bb75-43c4-8c79-56cd8ab66762" facs="#m-a483f329-5a42-4bea-8e05-cac4bb516af1" label="ambiguous">tibus quidem stultitia est; iis</l><l xml:id="m-e7b83bb2-2970-4667-9c5c-411f6235e466" facs="#m-de66709f-7905-40e1-8626-971d9ea24eac" label="lyrics-like">runt:nos autem praedicámus Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-52971c5e-419b-4651-87b6-062e00df7306" facs="#m-57c3ef2d-2d25-4fb1-afa1-586f89e80715" label="lyrics-like">stum crucifixum, Judaéis quidem</l><l xml:id="m-86d9c879-5d5c-40f7-99f3-c2790ae189f0" facs="#m-4a2ab912-08a4-4e04-bf0d-a89f4f1631fc" label="ambiguous">autem qui salvi fiunt, id est nobis,</l><l xml:id="m-effa3dc3-60f1-4ad7-98d7-a31aed5c8ff6" facs="#m-0913a748-6999-4445-b2d2-90fda732333d" label="lyrics-like">scándalum, Géntibus autem stultí¬</l><l xml:id="m-33ceeeb9-4462-49d8-bb30-4264a25db2f6" facs="#m-9ed4d0c8-2292-4160-9fe0-2796651af654" label="ambiguous">Dei virtus est. Scriptum est enim:</l><l xml:id="m-709da1a6-8e2c-45af-92df-2aad1da04ec8" facs="#m-f285f24d-e4a0-45d8-94e7-6677aa497f69" label="lyrics-like">tiam, ipsis autem vocátis Judaéis</l><l xml:id="m-737d74ef-3284-4468-9405-36c92e1a1399" facs="#m-9ad6e0e6-6bd8-4600-bc6f-1e5efb481ec5" label="lyrics-like">Perdam sapiéntiam sapiéntium, et</l><l xml:id="m-8657ab9a-8e75-4b28-988f-a465749a6a79" facs="#m-27b93248-9489-46cf-bf32-2cd3c2b942e6" label="lyrics-like">atque Graecis, Christum Dei virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c50a054-c812-4886-af2b-00e4d93bf167" facs="#m-7e46ad69-45a3-4ad0-9804-5484f98e7b58" label="lyrics-like">prudéntiam prudéntium reprobábo.</l><l xml:id="m-f8e9c910-54e6-4c61-a1ea-01d2ae2063a2" facs="#m-2449714e-0619-4283-807f-bda5a1bdfdab" label="lyrics-like">tem et Dei sapiéntiam. Quia quod</l><l xml:id="m-d789bbd6-8aaf-4236-867c-818513a9b185" facs="#m-10fb55b8-8444-483c-8669-177642598919" label="lyrics-like">Ubi sápiens? ubi scriba? ubi con¬</l><l xml:id="m-2649506c-1e50-4fea-85da-104e4c81af9a" facs="#m-cff0d3b7-fc4c-4e48-a24d-7bc96f5da4d1" label="lyrics-like">quisítor hujus saéculi? Nonne stul- stultum est Dei, sapiéntius est ho¬</l><l xml:id="m-b27caedf-b99b-4e33-8646-6a44adaeb106" facs="#m-5868ba06-66df-4f3c-8dd7-37db60c919a1" label="lyrics-like">mínibus; et quod infirmum est Dei,</l><l xml:id="m-f77e4d18-feac-4d6c-9dd9-e60db037466d" facs="#m-799f23ba-850d-48f5-8972-1a688f2292f3" label="lyrics-like">tam fecit Deus sapiéntiam hujus</l><l xml:id="m-a5c91da4-ab8f-46f9-bc31-33f4b9c269d7" facs="#m-11251084-cc2c-4b0f-803f-4233a5f33221" label="lyrics-like">mundi? Nam quia in Dei sapiéntia fórtius est homínibus. Ex ipso au¬</l><l xml:id="m-42f44049-9184-498a-90cd-7edb73320a9b" facs="#m-17743af5-0195-4fbf-a84a-f192dfdad23b" label="ambiguous">tem vos estis in Christo Jesu, qui</l><l xml:id="m-c812e3f7-4164-4a59-bea5-5db5c19735d0" facs="#m-9441e022-8513-44bd-98bb-ba630d933d57" label="lyrics-like">non cognóvit mundus per sapién¬</l><l xml:id="m-98465a01-f2c0-4e01-b1d8-1c33f21701e1" facs="#m-d0054dc3-5353-435b-bbbe-ba3e3070e5b3" label="lyrics-like">tiam Deum; plácuit Deo per stulti- factus est nobis sapiéntià a Deo,</l><l xml:id="m-30d9ae5c-6988-4e0b-9fb8-651317bbdf53" facs="#m-61269fcc-5572-4a3b-a314-dc33b46b3c2c" label="lyrics-like">tiam praedicatiónis salvos fácerel et justitia, et sanctificátio, et red¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d32410b-ebc4-4206-a944-2e4c573df8c7" facs="#m-684a290d-4d44-4f68-90b2-17787ea8fbfc" label="lyrics-like">credéntes. Quóniam et Judaéi signa lémptio.</l><l xml:id="m-f7dcca16-9647-4536-b31b-aa452ee55f7f" facs="#m-1e283cb9-d024-4f6a-b89e-181baf307747" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-e7898ece-7365-40c0-8e6b-39b2acc9a9ef" facs="#m-99262a6c-5c78-4bad-9ae9-68470b646fcd" label="lyrics-like">HLle¬ lú¬ ai</l><l xml:id="m-2adff379-dd10-4bbb-b880-5ec91beed74d" facs="#m-d9c043fe-9ca0-4c82-8e9e-a83e85cfe7da" label="lyrics-like">V. Sapi-énti-a hú- jus mún- di stultí¬</l><l xml:id="m-a132deb9-56d4-4f8f-9c5f-0c8c1181aa5d" facs="#m-84896e83-edcc-4b8e-9d0a-b21ae67e4eb6" label="lyrics-like">est apud Dé¬ um, scríptum est enim: Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d437fde-77b6-401a-858d-23e3a4b8ea14" facs="#m-01c0896b-bb34-4510-8b5f-f2f45d02909c" label="ambiguous">ti-a</l><l xml:id="m-ef706287-c2f3-43a1-bc6e-3e3f9939ec8f" facs="#m-03bceac6-bd66-4d75-ba5f-f29459f5f65a" label="lyrics-like">minus nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-700b11e6-ae5d-4721-a2a8-83327ef0dd5c" facs="#m-bce4addc-4e59-447d-93e6-dff903a5856d" label="lyrics-like">vit cogi-ta-ti-ô-nes sapi-énti-um, * quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-81df1cf7-70f7-4713-a5d2-7a3009caba00" facs="#m-43d085e9-351d-4608-8880-0d5be297f4bf" label="lyrics-like">ni-am vá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b448ca0-a3f0-4e42-a009-1e64646ae56b" facs="#m-7bc240b3-6282-4475-9f20-f0c0427f088a" label="ambiguous">nae sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-113a384a-9c22-4145-8256-a544949dec39" facs="#m-32f4b996-c67c-434e-8f0c-ca44a71dcfd2" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-045ab86a-28d3-4407-afff-23cf7dd7c267" facs="#m-f1cd281f-97c9-4d12-b496-e434009a19c7" label="lyrics-like">HLle¬ lúia</l><l xml:id="m-39ffa259-593f-4258-91ae-de2759801097" facs="#m-db6815b3-3288-4470-ac67-0e53ba20e5bf" label="lyrics-like">V. Verúm- tamen</l><l xml:id="m-ef83045d-61d2-4a6e-a855-fd12c8e39b9a" facs="#m-2df44b85-c805-4ea1-b9c9-e7313b2c06ef" label="ambiguous">stimo 6- mni-a detri¬</l><l xml:id="m-504d6823-c1de-4364-898e-ad110b30ef98" facs="#m-8116de25-397d-4078-ac1c-75b6a4ebe358" label="lyrics-like">ex-í¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
